            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dwand ng’atu moko m’ukok kumae, Wuyik yo pa Yehova i langa; wupot ng’omngele ni gengi ni Mungu mwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jubiting’o poga kubang’e kubang’e malu, man jubidwoko gudi kud ungulu gudi piny kubang’e kubang’e; man ka ma cung’ cung’ jubipoto, man ka ma tek ni pambu: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E dwong’ pa Yehova binyuthre, man weg kum ceke binene karacelo; kum dhu Yehova yero maeni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
