        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E in m’iyero rwonglembe ma ber ni Sayuni, idh malu wi got ma wiu; E in m’iyero rwonglembe ma ber ni Yerusalem, ting’ dwendi malu ku tego; ting’e malu, lworo kud unegi; wac ni adhura mi Yuda kumae, Nen, Mungu mu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.62.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 62:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.22.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nyu 22:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nen, Rwoth Yehova bibino calu jarukara, man bote bibimo pire: Nen, sukulia pare ni kude, man sukulia pare ni i wang’e. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.34.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Eze 34:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.10.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoh 10:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebikwayu udul rombe pare calu jakwac, ebicoko nyithi rombe i bote, man ebiting’ogi i kore, man ebipeyo ju ma nyithindhgi nuti yo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng’a ma poro pi i die cinge, man ma poro polo ku jampor, ma ng’eyo mukero mi kwio m’i ng’om de, man ma poro gudi ku mukero, ungulu gudi de ku mukero? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.11.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rum 11:34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.2.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kor 2:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng’a ma telo wi Tipo pa Yehova, kadi ma japorlembe pare ma ponje? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Giporo lembe giku ng’a, man ng’a ma ponje, ma ponje i yo mi pokolembe de, man ma ponje ku ng’eyong’ec, man ma nyutho ire yo mi ng’eyo lembe de? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nen, thek gi calu pi ma ton i agulu, man jukwanugi calu ng’ili utur m’i mukero: nen, eting’o cula calu gin ma nyathigi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Lebanon romo ngo mir awang’a, kadi limne de romo ngo mi lam m’awang’a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thek ceke gi calu gin moko ngo i wang’e; ekwanugi calu gin moko ngo, man ma ie nanu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
