            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.17.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tic 17:29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wubilund poro Mungu kud ang’o? kadi wubipore kud ayi ma nedi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayi gin m’acwia, jatic uthiedhe, jabodho de mwone ku mola ma kwar, man ethiedho nyoro mi mola ma tar pire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng’atu ma jacan hai ma copo nwang’u girathiera ma calu maeni ngo efoyo yen ma bitop ungo; eyenyo ire jatic ma riek kara eketh ayi gin m’acwia m’ang’ika malu, ma jubidaku ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wung’eyo ngo? wuwinjo ngo? juyero iwu ngo ugambre i thekri? wung’eyo ngo ugambre i thekri mi thepiny mi ng’omi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "En e ng’atu m’ubedo malu wi twodri mi ng’om, e ju m’ubedo i ie gi calu usene; m’urieyo polo calu bongu m’ang’aba, man epedhogi calu hema ma jubedo i ie; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "m’ujwigo judongomawijo ni gin moko ngo; m’udwoko jupoklembe m’i ng’om calu gin ma ie nanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyo, jupidhogi ngo; eyo, jucoyogi ngo; eyo, dundyen migi guro ulage i ng’om ungo: man ke ekudho wigi, e giner, man atido terogi cen calu soka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka kumeno wubipora ku ng’a, ma nia abed rom kude? Ng’atu Maleng’ uwacu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wung’ai weng’wu malu, man wunen ng’atu m’ucwio maeni, m’uwodho udulgi woko ku wel; elwong’ogi ceke ku nying’gi; ku dit mi tego pare, man kum en e jatego i tego, acel de mbe m’urem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iwacu nenedi, E Yakobo, man iyero nenedi, E Israel, kumae, Yo para bedo apana ni Yehova, man pokolembe ma ira kadhu woko ku ba Mungu para? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ing’eyo ngo? iwinjo ngo kumae? Mungu ma bedo rondo ku rondo, Yehova, Jacwi tung’ ng’om, voc ungo, kadi eol de ngo; ng’eyong’ec pare yenjre ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emio tego ni ju m’uvoc; man emedo tego ni ng’atu ma tego mbe kude. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cil awia ma co gibivoc man gibiol, man awobi bipodho ma gwei: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ento ju m’ukuro Yehova tego ma nyen bidwogo igi; gibituk ku bomb ma calu acur: gibiringo, e gibiol ungo; gibiwotho, e gibivoc ungo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
